<title>USA: CINergy Corp Q3 revs $765.7 mln vs $765.5.</title>
<headline>CINergy Corp Q3 revs $765.7 mln vs $765.5.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Rounded to thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>    Third Quarter				1996		1995</p>
<p> Revenues				   $  765,704     $  765,494</p>
<p> Net income				     98,030	  108,917</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>   Net income				     0.51	     0.69</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding		157,679	  156,945</p>
<p>    12 Mo. ended 9/30			  1996	     1995</p>
<p> Revenues				   $3,150,794     $2,927,891</p>
<p> Net income				    340,840	  255,889</p>
<p>Earnings per share</p>
<p>   Net income				     2.05	     1.62</p>
<p> Average shares outstanding		157,633	  154,797</p>
<p>NOTE - Q3 1996 net excludes costs of $18.2 million to reacquire preferred stock of subsidiary which reduced net income available to common stock, cutting 1996 per share results $0.12 from $0.63 in quarter and $2.17 in 12 months.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
